# nv-codec-headers n13.1.15.0 matches driver 610+ (the GCP L4 hosts run 615) and enables NVDEC
# decode into CUDA arrays. Driver 595 hosts (AWS g6f/g6) speak NVENC API 13.0 only and fail with
# "Driver does not support the required nvenc API version"; build images for them with
# --build-arg NV_CODEC_HEADERS_TAG=n13.0.19.0
# --build-arg NV_CODEC_HEADERS_COMMIT=e844e5b26f46bb77479f063029595293aa8f812d
